# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Real environment files, never committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

# Credential material of any kind. These patterns are deliberately broad: the
# cost of an ignored file that should have been committed is a moment's
# confusion, and the cost of the reverse is a rotation.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
id_rsa*
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
secrets.*
data.txt

# ── Dependencies and build output ────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules
dist
build
out
.next
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Local tooling ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vercel
.DS_Store
*.log
logs/
.vite
